# Trigonometry (B13): s_in, c_os and a_tan in radians give a Float for
# any number, item by item; p_i is niladic, applied to @.
== SOURCE
p_i @
c_os p_i @
s_in 0 1
c_os 0.0
a_tan 1
4 * a_tan 1
(s_in 0.5)^2 + (c_os 0.5)^2
== TYPE
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
